# Risk Manager — root environment reference.
# The backend reads .env from risk-manager/backend/ (see backend/.env.example
# for the full, current variable list with defaults). The frontend reads
# VITE_DEMO_API_KEY (see frontend/.env.example). This file is kept as a pointer
# so nobody edits a stale copy.

# Policy thresholds are NOT env vars anymore — they live in the versioned
# backend/src/policy/policy.config.json (view live at GET /api/policy/config).
